"text": "Your PC takes forever to start... and this is why.\nEvery app you install wants to launch with Windows.\nAnd each one slows your startup down.\nHere's the fix.\nPress Control, Shift, Escape to open Task Manager.\nClick Startup apps.\nLook at the Startup impact column.\nSee an app marked High that you don't need right away?\nRight-click it... and choose Disable.\nRestart, and feel the difference.\nFollow for more Windows fixes that actually work.\nBecause your PC shouldn't take forever to start."
